---
// HandshakeVisualizer.astro - Visualizer for the Official SAM-UP Left-Hand Handshake (Article V)
---

<div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12 border border-[#D4AF37]/20 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 items-center">
    <!-- Left: Geometric Anatomical Diagram -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative min-h-[340px]">
      <div class="relative w-64 h-64 sm:w-72 sm:h-72 flex items-center justify-center">
        <!-- Ambient Radial Glow -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37]/10 blur-2xl"></div>

        <svg
          class="w-full h-full relative z-10"
          viewBox="0 0 320 320"
          fill="none"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        >
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="hsGold" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FFF6D1" />
              <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#D4AF37" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#AA820A" />
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="hsOnyx" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2A3447" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0E131C" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>

          <!-- Outer Radar Matrix -->
          <circle
            cx="160"
            cy="160"
            r="145"
            stroke="#D4AF37"
            stroke-width="1"
            stroke-dasharray="4 6"
            opacity="0.3"
          />
          <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="110" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.15" />

          <!-- Left Hand Palm Base -->
          <path
            d="M 120 280 L 120 180 C 120 160, 140 140, 160 140 C 180 140, 200 160, 200 180 L 200 280 Z"
            fill="url(#hsOnyx)"
            stroke="url(#hsGold)"
            stroke-width="3"
          />

          <!-- Thumb (Spread Apart - Camaraderie) -->
          <path
            id="hs-thumb"
            class="hs-part cursor-pointer transition-[filter] duration-300 hover:brightness-125"
            d="M 120 190 C 100 180, 70 165, 55 145 C 45 130, 50 115, 65 115 C 80 115, 105 145, 125 160 Z"
            fill="url(#hsGold)"
            stroke="#FFF6D1"
            stroke-width="2"
          />

          <!-- Index Finger (Apart - Academic Excellence) -->
          <path
            id="hs-index"
            class="hs-part cursor-pointer transition-[filter] duration-300 hover:brightness-125"
            d="M 132 140 L 132 60 C 132 45, 150 45, 150 60 L 150 140 Z"
            fill="url(#hsGold)"
            stroke="#FFF6D1"
            stroke-width="2"
          />

          <!-- 3 Joined Fingers: Middle, Ring, Pinky (Three Core Principles) -->
          <g
            id="hs-adjoined"
            class="hs-part cursor-pointer transition-[filter] duration-300 hover:brightness-125"
          >
            <!-- Middle Finger -->
            <path
              d="M 155 140 L 155 45 C 155 30, 172 30, 172 45 L 172 140 Z"
              fill="#D4AF37"
              stroke="#FFF6D1"
              stroke-width="1.5"
            />
            <!-- Ring Finger -->
            <path
              d="M 174 140 L 174 55 C 174 40, 190 40, 190 55 L 190 140 Z"
              fill="#C69E24"
              stroke="#FFF6D1"
              stroke-width="1.5"
            />
            <!-- Pinky Finger -->
            <path
              d="M 192 140 L 192 75 C 192 60, 206 60, 206 75 L 206 140 Z"
              fill="#B38B12"
              stroke="#FFF6D1"
              stroke-width="1.5"
            />
            <!-- Bonding Ribbon across the 3 fingers -->
            <rect x="153" y="90" width="55" height="12" rx="4" fill="#FDF1BA" opacity="0.8" />
          </g>

          <!-- Left Hand Badge -->
          <circle cx="160" cy="225" r="24" fill="#0B0E14" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2" />
          <text
            x="160"
            y="230"
            text-anchor="middle"
            fill="#F5D77F"
            font-size="12"
            font-family="monospace"
            font-weight="bold"
          >
            LEFT
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mt-2">Article V: The Sacred Left-Hand Bond</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Handshake Anatomy Explanation -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-3.5">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <span class="text-base">🖐️</span>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-display font-bold text-[#F5D77F]">1. The Left Hand (Uniqueness)</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The execution with the left hand signifies the distinct identity and non-conformist mathematical
          uniqueness of SAM-UP members.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <span class="text-base">🤝</span>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-display font-bold text-[#F5D77F]">2. The Three Adjoined Fingers</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The middle finger, ring finger, and pinky are locked firmly together, representing the{' '}
          <strong>Three Inviolate Principles</strong>: Equality, Unity, and Loyalty & Commitment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <span class="text-base">☝️</span>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-display font-bold text-[#F5D77F]">3. Index Finger & Thumb</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The index finger stands for <strong>Academic Excellence</strong>, while the spread thumb embodies{' '}
          <strong>Camaraderie</strong>. The index is placed firmly between the thumb and index finger of the
          fellow member's left hand.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
